<ans># Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd — 9MFY25 Financial Data (Nine Months Ended December 31, 2024)

## Data Extraction Summary

I directly opened and read all five specified documents. Here is what each contained:

- **December-31-2024.pdf** (financial results filing) — the only document with financial data; served as the primary source for all extracted figures.
- **Compliance-Certificate-December-2024.pdf** — pure SEBI regulatory filing confirming compliance with share transfer/demat norms; contains **zero financial data**.
- **Details-of-the-Compliance-officer-December-2024.pdf** — administrative filing naming Mr. Rajat Sharma as Compliance Officer; **zero financial data**.
- **Details-of-the-RTA-December-2024.pdf** — RTA (Registrar & Transfer Agent) confirmation document; **zero financial data**.
- **investor-relations.aspx** — a navigation/index landing page linking to other documents, not itself a financial statement; contributed no values directly.

No separate "Investor Presentation 9MFY25" or IRDAI NL-1/NL-2 return PDFs were among the five documents provided, so line items not appearing in the December-31-2024 statement have been left blank rather than substituted from other sources.

